# Adapted from the Standard Tamil apertium-tam available at https://github.com/apertium/apertium-tam.git, by Maathavan Nithiyananthan <maathumaathavan@gmail.com>
# Morphological Transducer for Jaffna Tamil

# Part of speech categories
# <prn>    # Pronoun
# <n>      # Noun
# <np>     # Proper nouns
# <top>    # Toponyms
# <v>      # Verb
# <vbmod>  # Modal verb
# <vbser>  # Verb 'to be'
# <vbdo>   # Verb 'to do'
# <vaux>   # Auxiliary verb
# <adj>    # Adjective
# <adv>    # Adverb
# <det>    # Determiner
# <comp>   # Comparative
# <post>   # Postposition
# <emph>   # Emphatic particle
# <caus>   # Causative particle
# <neg>    # Negative particle
# <num>    # Numeral

# <sent>   # Sentence-ending punctuation
# <guio>   # Hyphen
# <cm>     # Comma
# <apos>   # Apostrophe
# <quot>   # Quotation mark
# <lquot>  # Left quotation mark
# <rquot>  # Right quotation mark
# <lpar>   # Left parenthesis
# <rpar>   # Right parenthesis

# Number morphology
# <sg>     # Singular
# <pl>     # Plural
# <epl>    # Epicene Plural
# <unc>    # Uncountable

# Other symbols
# >        # Morpheme boundary

###############################################################################
###                       M O R P H O T A C T I C S                         ###
###############################################################################

################################     PATTERNS     ################################
PATTERNS
# Pronouns
## Personals
### Locative
Location(1) PronounStems[LOC,GPro] Number[GPro] Location(2) Cases[P] InterroClitic?
Location(1) PronounStems[LOC,FPro] Number[FPro] Location(2) Cases[P] InterroClitic?
#### Honorifics
Location(1) PronounStems[LOC,MH] Honorifics[MH] Number[MH] Location(2) Cases[P] InterroClitic?
Location(1) PronounStems[LOC,FH] Honorifics[FH] Number[FH] Location(2) Cases[P] InterroClitic?
Location(1) PronounStems[LOC,EHIrr] Honorifics[EHIrr] Number[EHIrr] Location(2) Cases[P] InterroClitic?
Location(1) PronounStems[LOC,EHIrr] Honorifics[EHIrrN] Number[EHIrr] Location(2) Cases[EHIrrN] InterroClitic?
#### Interrogative Prefixing
InterroPrefix(1) PronounStems[LOC,GPro] Number[GPro] Cases[P] InterroPrefix(2)
InterroPrefix(1) PronounStems[LOC,FPro] Number[FPro] Cases[P] InterroPrefix(2)
InterroPrefix(1) PronounStems[LOC,MH] Honorifics[MH] Number[MH] Cases[P] InterroPrefix(2)
InterroPrefix(1) PronounStems[LOC,FH] Honorifics[FH] Number[FH] Cases[P] InterroPrefix(2)
InterroPrefix(1) PronounStems[LOC,EHIrr] Honorifics[EHIrr] Number[EHIrr] Cases[P] InterroPrefix(2)
### Non-locative
PronounStems[-LOC,Obl,GPro] Number[PS] Cases[PS] InterroClitic?
PronounStems[-LOC,Obl,GPro] Number[PL] Cases[PL] InterroClitic?
PronounStems[-LOC,NObl,GPro] Number[GPro] InterroClitic?
#### Honorifics
PronounStems[-LOC,Obl,PH] Honorifics[PH] Number[PH,PS] Cases[PS] InterroClitic?
PronounStems[-LOC,Obl,IH] Honorifics[IH] Number[IH,PS] Cases[PS] InterroClitic?
PronounStems[-LOC,NObl,PH] Honorifics[PH] Number[PH] InterroClitic?
PronounStems[-LOC,NObl,IH] Honorifics[IH] Number[IH] InterroClitic?
## Other Types
IndefProStem ((HumanRadical[Hum] Cases[AA])|(HumanRadical[NHum] Cases[NN]))? TotalClitic
# Nouns & NP
## Irregulars
Nouns[NQ] Adjectivizer EndwordMorph?
Nouns[NN,ANoun] Number[ANoun] Cases[NN]|EmphaticSuf|Adverbializer|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Nouns[NN,QNoun] Number[QNoun] Cases[NN]|EmphaticSuf|Adverbializer|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Nouns[NN,UNoun] Number[UNoun] Cases[NN]|EmphaticSuf|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Nouns[NN,FNoun] Number[FNoun] Cases[NN]|EmphaticSuf|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Nouns[TNoun] Number[TNoun] Cases[TN]|EmphaticSuf|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Nouns[AA,ES] Number[ES] Cases[AA]|EmphaticSuf|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Nouns[VIrr,Pl1] Number[Pl1] Cases[VIrr] EndwordMorph?
## REGULAR
Nouns[AA,H] Honorifics[H] Number[H] Cases[AA]|EmphaticSuf|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Nouns[AA,EH] Honorifics[H] Number[EH] Cases[AA]|EmphaticSuf|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
