Nouns[AA,Pl1] Number[Pl1]|(Honorifics[Pl1] Number[H]) Cases[AA]|EmphaticSuf|Adverbializer|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Nouns[NN,Pl2] Number[Pl2] Cases[NN]|EmphaticSuf|Adverbializer|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
