Nouns[NN,Pl4] Number[Pl4] Cases[NN]|EmphaticSuf|Adverbializer|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Nouns[AA,Pl4] Number[Pl4]|(Honorifics[Pl4] Number[H]) Cases[AA]|EmphaticSuf|Adverbializer|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Nouns[NN,Pl5] Number[Pl5] Cases[NN]|EmphaticSuf|Adverbializer|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Nouns[AA,Pl5] Number[Pl5]|(Honorifics[Pl5] Number[H]) Cases[AA]|EmphaticSuf|Adverbializer|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Nouns[NN,Pl6] Number[Pl6] Cases[NN]|EmphaticSuf|Adverbializer|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
