Adjectives[BOTH] [ <adj>: ] > ((Adverbializer EndwordMorph?)|(Nominalizer[ADJ] (Adjectivizer EndwordMorph?)|(Number[ANoun] Cases[NN]|EmphaticSuf|Adverbializer|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?)))
Adjectives[FROZE] [ <adj>: ] Nominalizer[ADJ] Number[ANoun] Cases[NN]|EmphaticSuf|Adverbializer|TotalClitic EndwordMorph?
Adjectives [ <adj>: ] Predicative[NPREDS] Number[ENS]
Adjectives [ <adj>: ] Predicative[NPREDP] Number[ENP] 
Adjectives [ <adj>: ] Predicative[PREDP] Number[EHIrr2] Honorifics[EHIrr2]
Adjectives [ <adj>: ] Predicative[APRED] Honorifics[H]? Number[GPro]
